\newlabel{tab:within_class_density}{{V}{10}{Within-class density-stratified $f_{\rm CW}$ for the V-Web cluster and filament classes (matched-spiral $n_{\rm cluster} = 397{,}505$, $n_{\rm filament} = 408{,}187$). Quartiles binned by the V-Web per-galaxy \emph {log}-density covariate of \S \ref {sec:vweb_algo} step~12; $\bar \rho $ is the quartile mean of $\log _{10}(1 + \delta _{\rm smooth})$ (Gaussian-smoothed overdensity in units of the cube-mean cell density, NN-interpolated to each galaxy position; dimensionless). Quartile membership is identical under the linear density (monotone transform); definition verified by exact recompute in \artifact {pipelines/p5\_desi\_chirality/outputs/21\_r23conf\_meta\_closures.json}. The $\sigma _{\rm from\,half}$ values scale as $\sqrt {n}$ at fixed offset and are not comparable across rows of different $n$; the inferential comparison is the monopole-referenced residual of \S \ref {sec:stats}}{table.5}{}}
