\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Phase 2 sensitivity heat-map: per-cell range of $f_{\rm  CW}$ across the four environment classes \{void, wall, filament, cluster\} in percentage points, on the declared env-labeled spiral parent. Each cell corresponds to a complete V-Web re-run on the $14{,}622{,}283$-galaxy DESI DR1 spectro sample at $(R_s, \lambda _{\rm  th})$. The maximum range across all nine cells is $4.12$\,percentage points (at $R_s\!=\!50\,{\rm  Mpc}/h, \lambda _{\rm  th}\!=\!0.1$), dominated by the void-bin counting noise ($n_{\rm  void} \le 853$ in every cell); the per-class monopole-subtracted residuals stay below $1.87\sigma $ in all cells (Table~\ref {tab:phase2}). The headline environmental-independence result is robust to V-Web hyperparameter choices over the range probed.}}{16}{figure.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:phase2}{{7}{16}{Phase 2 sensitivity heat-map: per-cell range of $f_{\rm CW}$ across the four environment classes \{void, wall, filament, cluster\} in percentage points, on the declared env-labeled spiral parent. Each cell corresponds to a complete V-Web re-run on the $14{,}622{,}283$-galaxy DESI DR1 spectro sample at $(R_s, \lambda _{\rm th})$. The maximum range across all nine cells is $4.12$\,percentage points (at $R_s\!=\!50\,{\rm Mpc}/h, \lambda _{\rm th}\!=\!0.1$), dominated by the void-bin counting noise ($n_{\rm void} \le 853$ in every cell); the per-class monopole-subtracted residuals stay below $1.87\sigma $ in all cells (Table~\ref {tab:phase2}). The headline environmental-independence result is robust to V-Web hyperparameter choices over the range probed}{figure.7}{}}
